{"id": "4692c5f3-51f3-40d0-9872-2f39525e7cb3", "type": "action", "name": "電池セルを放電する", "description": "1 It(A)で終止条件まで放電を行う", "stereotypes": [], "metaData": {"version": 1.0, "createdBy": null, "createdDate": "2026-06-24T22:19:52.804561", "ref": null}, "actionSubType": "opaque", "body": "規定の放電電流（1 It[A]）にて、企業が定める放電終止条件に到達するまで一定電流で放電を行う。", "language": "text", "behaviorRef": null, "objectType": null, "objectBlockRef": null, "inState": null, "upperBound": null, "ordering": null, "isFlowFinal": null, "decisionInput": null, "joinSpec": null, "className": "ActivityNode"}
